// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
// === ELEMENT SPEC ===
// sample inlet → CylinderGeometry(0.08,0.08,0.5) grey #999, at (-3.4,0,0) rotZ 90°
// chamber cap → SphereGeometry(0.55) half, at (-3,0,0)
