// electron rays → 5 Lines #ffcc00 fan upward from source
// ion cloud → 8 SphereGeometry(0.04) #2bb3b3 near (-2.0,0,0)
// lens1 → RingGeometry(0.12,0.55,32) #9999cc at (-1.2,0,0) rotY 90°
// lens2 → RingGeometry(0.12,0.55,32) #9999cc at (-0.4,0,0) rotY 90°
